~ start
Narrator: The court found Ayan guilty of first degree murder...
Narrator: To his confusion, all evidence seemed to point towards him.
Narrator: Now, in his jail cell, Ayan is presented with 2 choices...
- Give up
	do GameState.fields["next_act"] = ""
	do GameManager.go_to_main_menu()
- Make the right choice
	do GameState.fields["next_act"] = "act_2"
=> END